# Line endings are decided here rather than by whoever cloned the repository.
# Without this, core.autocrlf governs, which differs between machines and makes
# git report changes to files nobody edited.
#
# LF in the repository and LF in the working tree. Visual Studio, MSBuild and
# PowerShell all read LF happily on Windows; only .bat and .cmd genuinely need
# CRLF, and there are none here.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.zip binary
